WEBVTT

00:08:29.596 --> 00:08:31.836
maybe with the exception
of women's rights,

00:08:31.836 --> 00:08:35.156
where I couldn't comprehend
his thoughts --

00:08:35.156 --> 00:08:36.916
it was really nice.

00:08:36.956 --> 00:08:39.436
After our discussion, I Googled Mirko.

00:08:40.676 --> 00:08:45.716
And I found out that in his teenage years,
he used to be a neo-Nazi.

00:08:47.356 --> 00:08:49.356
So I called him and asked,

00:08:49.356 --> 00:08:51.076
"Hey, why didn't you tell me?"

00:08:51.116 --> 00:08:55.436
And he said, "You know, I didn't tell you
because I want to get over it.

00:08:55.476 --> 00:08:58.516
I just don't want
to talk about it anymore."